  "A roof pitched under its covering's least pitch is warned of, as it may not shed water.": "Se avisa de una cubierta con pendiente inferior a la mínima de su cobertura, ya que puede no evacuar el agua.",
  "A set of your own, started from the residential one": "Un conjunto propio, a partir del residencial",
